From dfda983d07205a2b6eb1d09c8286aa1bb5d31ad8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: azkali <a.ffcc7@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 16:38:09 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] extevdev: Fix startup crash when no input device is found

[extevdev] Fix startup crash when no input device is found.

On devices without a headphone jack input device find_input_device()
finds nothing, setup() fails and pa_droid_extevdev_new() calls
pa_droid_extevdev_free() with u->event still NULL. mainloop_io_free()
asserts on the NULL event and aborts the whole daemon:

E: [pulseaudio] droid-extevdev.c: could not start input device detection.
E: [pulseaudio] mainloop.c: Assertion 'e' failed at ../src/pulse/mainloop.c:206, function mainloop_io_free(). Aborting.

Only free the io event if it was created.
---
 src/droid/droid-extevdev.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/droid/droid-extevdev.c b/src/droid/droid-extevdev.c
index 9c15327..c310dea 100644
--- a/src/droid/droid-extevdev.c
+++ b/src/droid/droid-extevdev.c
@@ -275,7 +275,8 @@ void pa_droid_extevdev_free(pa_droid_extevdev *u) {
     if (!u)
         return;
 
-    u->card->core->mainloop->io_free(u->event);
+    if (u->event)
+        u->card->core->mainloop->io_free(u->event);
 
     pa_xfree(u);
 }
